                  "text": "7–12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha nchiona dzinyama rinatuluka kula baharini. Naro kala rina vitswa sabaa na pembe kumi, na chila pembe kala ikavwikpwa chiremba. Na dzulu ya chila chitswa kala chikaandikpwa dzina ra kumkufuru Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.7.4+DAN.7.5+DAN.7.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Danieli 7:4–6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dzinyama hiro roriona kala rikaigana na tsui, ela maguluge kala ni dza ga dubu na mlomowe kala ni dza wa simba. Naro dzoka richiripha rira dzinyama nguvuze, chihi cha ufalumewe na uwezo munji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chitswa chimwenga chaonekana avi china chironda cha chirema, ela chichikala chikaphola hata ni kuphyu. Nao atu osi duniani aangalazwa ni hiro dzinyama phahi achirilunga achikala afuasie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu aabudu ro dzoka kpwa vira kala rikaripha rira dzinyama uwezowe wa kutawala. Tsona achiabudu ro dzinyama kuno anaamba, “Taphana ariye na uwezo dza ro dzinyama, wala taphana awezaye kurishinda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
